# Frontend

Build UI with SolidJS, Vite, and the Feature-Sliced slices that already exist. Style with `app.css`. Do not add Kobalte or UnoCSS until HTML and that stylesheet cannot do the job.

## i18n

Never hardcode user-visible strings in components, pages, or features. That includes `aria-label`, `title`, `alt`, and placeholders.

- Locale files: `src/shared/locales/en/<namespace>.json`.
- Namespaces follow UI domains (`common`, `greeting`), not components.
- Keys are stable identifiers (`greeting.submit`), not English sentences.
- Interpolate with `{{name}}`. Do not concatenate translated fragments.
- Call `const [t] = useTranslation("greeting")` from `solid-i18next`. Do not wrap i18next.
- Map API error codes to keys. Do not render a message returned by the API.

```tsx
const [t] = useTranslation("greeting");
return <h1>{t("title", { ns: "greeting" })}</h1>;
```

```tsx
// Bad
return <h1>Say hello</h1>;
```

Tests render the default English copy with happy-dom. Do not test i18next itself.
